Here is the generated code to evaluate:

<!-- @FIGURE_UI_BEGIN -->
<span id="demoNarration" style="display:block;margin:0;font-size:10px;max-width:260px;line-height:1.35"></span><span style="display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center"><button onclick="prevStep()">◀</button><span id="stepLabel"></span><button onclick="nextStep()">▶</button></span><label>Ring radius r / R: <output id="ringRadiusVal">0.55</output><input id="ringRadiusInput" type="range" min="0.05" max="1" step="0.01" value="0.55" oninput="document.getElementById('ringRadiusVal').value=this.value;update_ringRadius(+this.value)"></label><label>Annulus width dr / R: <output id="annulusWidthVal">0.06</output><input id="annulusWidthInput" type="range" min="0.02" max="0.2" step="0.01" value="0.06" oninput="document.getElementById('annulusWidthVal').value=this.value;update_annulusWidth(+this.value)"></label><label><input id="viewEmphasisInput" type="checkbox" onchange="toggle_viewEmphasis(this.checked)"> View emphasis: <output id="viewEmphasisVal">Face-on disk</output></label><span style="font-size:10px;line-height:1.35;color:#555">Tip: drag r and dr, then compare the orange ring in both views.</span>
